        "id": 1402878
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-06T20:18:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That is a fused change out of a cherry-pick of 4ca8a0bc83543a0d29a7f5a8b1e8ef3c23dab242 and a partial cherry-pick of https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/common/+/29f006fdefe6f88abde973a0b0f20d2704e93fd4. Please separate the picked changes. Please also clarify why 29f006fdefe6f88abde973a0b0f20d2704e93fd4 is not entirely applied.",
      "revId": "f5a76f7486056616148992d352db6e9a225e4136",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9132c088_1f609035",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 3278615
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-19T10:33:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is a big change between upstream and android12-5.10 codebase, so I cannot backport full change of 29f006fdefe6f88abde973a0b0f20d2704e93fd4 into android12-5.10 codebase, For the change of 4ca8a0bc83543a0d29a7f5a8b1e8ef3c23dab242, we only need to use try_cmpxchg(), so it\u0027s not necessary backport full change of 29f006fdefe6f88abde973a0b0f20d2704e93fd4.\n\nThis patch is introduced to fix the critical race issue for platforms support MTE on android12-5.10 codebase.\n\nWill it be fine if I separate the partial cherry-pick change from this change?\nThanks",
      "parentUuid": "c22234c3_888fd851",
      "revId": "f5a76f7486056616148992d352db6e9a225e4136",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7e3fa755_53f55176",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1572468
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-19T12:27:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If you\u0027re not able to backport the upstream patches directly, then please can you work with the upstream community to get a fix agreed on for the stable 5.10 kernel? Then we can cherry-pick that into android12-5.10, knowing that it\u0027s been reviewed by the right experts on the mailing list. Thanks.",
      "parentUuid": "9132c088_1f609035",
      "revId": "f5a76f7486056616148992d352db6e9a225e4136",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7dd810e9_9db04b59",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 3278615
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-21T03:43:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The HW-tag-based KASAN feature is introduced since kernel tag version 5.11, which is not supported on upstream stable 5.10 kernel. Since try_cmpxchg() is not used by someone in stable 5.10 kernel tree, I think introducing try_cmpxchg() fallback won\u0027t be accepted by upstream.",
      "parentUuid": "7e3fa755_53f55176",
      "revId": "f5a76f7486056616148992d352db6e9a225e4136",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f4679fb5_2020827f",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
